  "visualBrief": "Five-stage elliptical red-brick/buff terracotta hall, square lower and round upper window rings, pale pilasters/cornices/open balustrades, brown mosaic band with original abstract pale relief rhythm, stepped upper drum, opaque gridded glazed dome with30radial ribs/white intermediate pediment ring and low oval lantern. Three large N/E/W recessed arched porches and smaller pedimented/oculus south porch with entrance flights. No auditorium interior, adjacent college/mansions, detached chimney/memorials or photo pixels.",
